<title>USA: St Paul cattle trade steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul cattle trade steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compared to Wednesday small supply slaughter steers and heifers fully steady. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers: Few Choice 2-4 1180-1400 lbs 63.50-64.00. Few Select and Choice 2-3 1050-1200 lbs 62.00-63.50.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers: Few Choice 2-4 1150-1300 lbs 62.00-63.50. Select 1000-1100 lbs 58.50-60.00.</p>
</text>
